# Nexus runtime artifacts (generated by `nexus init` / `journal` commands).
# profile.json is committed as the project configuration source of truth.
.nexus/*
!.nexus/profile.json
BOOTSTRAP.md

# Nexus-generated IDE rule files (overwrite-mode — fully regenerated from
# .nexus/profile.json on demand). After a fresh clone, run:
#   nexus init --upgrade --accept-defaults
# to materialize these. They are intentionally not tracked because the
# .nexus/profile.json single source of truth + nexus_version stamp is enough
# to reconstruct them deterministically; gitignoring avoids diff noise on
# every regeneration.
#
# Files explicitly NOT ignored (kept tracked because they carry user content
# OR are hand-curated, NOT auto-generated):
#   - AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .github/copilot-instructions.md  (upsert mode:
#     content outside <!-- nexus:*:begin --> markers is user-owned)
#   - .codeiumignore                                         (hand-curated)
#   - .agents/skills/                                        (canonical shared skills)
#   - .windsurf/                                             (legacy migration input only)
.cursor/rules/00-core.mdc
.cursor/rules/10-*.mdc
.cursor/rules/state.mdc
.github/instructions/*.instructions.md

# Nexus - Exclude non-essential files
COMMIT_SUMMARY.md
NexusHealthMasterPlan.md
Nexus Health Audit and Tracking Plan.md
NexusUpgradePlan.md
linkedin-post.md
ws-bootstrap-master.code-workspace

